<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa National Chick says in talks.</title>
<headline>S.Africa National Chick says in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's National Chick Ltd said on Tuesday it was in talks which could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>The firm urged its shareholders to exercise caution in their share dealings until further details are announced.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
